Agent mood: dh agmd wa7d 34an bysht8l ben kol el files w byktblk eli enta 3awzo w by3ml edit f el files 3ady
Ask mood: dh enta bts2lo w bygawbk w b3dha enta momkn t7wl ll agent mood w t2olo nfz eli enta l2eto
Edit Mood: small edit in individual files
Plan Mood: dh b2a enta da5l 3 feature w 3awzo yfkr m3ak w y plan m3ak kol haga w kda.

==============================================================================================================
How to solve or do some task ?
	-use plan mood first.
	-be specific while give him info in details, good resources like files related to the feature that you need to implement.
	-at the end of the prompt, give some examples of what expected to get.
==============================================================================================================
Prompt files: 
	-de enta bt create prompt files w btdelo name w desc w t7dd no3 el agent.
	-w ynf3 kman tdelo input zy esm el file w el hagat de.
==============================================================================================================
How to use some tricks:-
	-lw ktbt hash (#) w b3dha ktbt esm el file + enk kman tkon m7dd el file dh f el context dh byshl 3aleh hagat ktera.
	-lw ktbt back slash (/) hytl3lk el prompt eli enta btst5dmha w sa3tha e5tarha w edyha el input bta3ha
	-lw ktbt /help: dh hyshr7lk hagat ktera w kda.
	-momkn kman lma t select block of code w tdos 3la 3lamt el lamba y2olk review aw write tests w kda.
	-lw 3mlt changes f el code w 3mlt add ll files, htla2y 3lamt el ngom de mkan el commit msg lw dost 3aleha hydek esm
	el commit msg mn 8er ma enta eli tfkr.
	-
==============================================================================================================
Instructions:-
	-de fe mnha chat instructions, enk msln t3ml instruction file m5sos w ytnfz 3 el ba2y w kda.
	-aw fe haga esmha AGENTS.MD
==============================================================================================================
MCP Server:-(Model Context Protocol)
============
	-https://modelcontextprotocol.io/docs/getting-started/intro
	-el fikra mn el mcp server: bt5ly el agent bta3k yb2a m3ah other resources ygeb mnha info msh bs el project bta3k.
	-34an t3ml add mcp server
	-htdos: ctrl + shift + p = w tktb f el search mcp server
	-w t5tar add server w tshof b2a mn el list eli httl3lk 3 gamb enta 3awz t install men f dol.
	-aw ndos 3la 3lamt el settings f chat w n5tar mcp servers.
	-f mcp servers koisa momkn t3mlha install such as context7
	-bs 5od balk mt3mlsh install l hagat kter 34an dh bya5od tokens ktera w bysthlk awi, fa e5tar haga enta m7tagha bgd.
	
	

